    "modals": [
      "Buy 3 Tires, Get the 4th for $1* Offer valid November 16-30, 2026 *Buy 3 eligible Hankook tires, get the 4th for $1. Hankook OEM, OEA, WIN tires only. Must be installed by participating Nissan dealer by 12/07/2026. Taxes, installation, and other fees extra. Price and offer availability may vary by model. No cash value. May not be combined with other offers. Void where prohibited. Other restrictions apply. See participating dealer for full details. Ends 11/30/2026. Shop for Tires",
      "Buy 3 Tires, Get the 4th for $1* Offer valid November 16-30, 2026 *Buy 3 eligible Hankook tires, get the 4th for $1. Hankook OEM, OEA, WIN tires only. Must be installed by participating Nissan dealer by 12/07/2026. Taxes, installation, and other fees extra. Price and offer availability may vary by model. No cash value. May not be combined with other offers. Void where prohibited. Other restrictions apply. See participating dealer for full details. Ends 11/30/2026. Shop for Tires",
      "Buy 3 Tires, Get the 4th for $1* Offer valid November 16-30, 2026 *Buy 3 eligible Hankook tires, get the 4th for $1. Hankook OEM, OEA, WIN tires only. Must be installed by participating Nissan dealer by 12/07/2026. Taxes, installation, and other fees extra. Price and offer availability may vary by model. No cash value. May not be combined with other offers. Void where prohibited. Other restrictions apply. See participating dealer for full details. Ends 11/30/2026. Shop for Tires",
      "Buy 4, Get 1 FREE Oil & Filter Changes* Offer valid through January 4, 2027. Restrictions apply. See terms & conditions. *Buy 4, Get 1 Free Offer. Purchase a 5-Pack Prepaid Maintenance Agreement (PMA) and receive the fifth oil and filter replacement at no additional charge. Coverage expires after 30 months or 25,000 miles, whichever occurs first. No cash value. Taxes and dealer fees not included. Pricing subject to change based on market conditions. Nissan vehicles only. Other restrictions apply. READ THE 5-PACK PMA at https://nissan-securityplus.com/buy-4-get-1-free/ OR AT YOUR DEALER, AS ITS TERMS, CONDITIONS, EXCLUSIONS, AND LIMITATIONS CONTROL. In Florida (License #60128), Missouri, North Dakota, Oregon and Vermont, Security+Plus is backed by Nissan Extended Services North America, Inc., P.O. Box 685004, Franklin, TN 37068-5004. Security+Plus® is a trademark of Nissan North America, Inc. Ends 01/04/2027. Purchase Today",
      "Buy 3 Tires, Get the 4th for $1* Offer valid November 16-30, 2026 *Buy 3 eligible Hankook tires, get the 4th for $1. Hankook OEM, OEA, WIN tires only. Must be installed by participating Nissan dealer by 12/07/2026. Taxes, installation, and other fees extra. Price and offer availability may vary by model. No cash value. May not be combined with other offers. Void where prohibited. Other restrictions apply. See participating dealer for full details. Ends 11/30/2026. Shop for Tires",
      "Buy 3 Eligible Tires, Get the 4th for $1* Offer valid February 1 - April 30, 2025 *Offer available for a limited time. Eligible on select OEM, OEA, and WIN tires only when purchased from and installed by a participating Nissan dealer. Other restrictions apply. See dealer for details. Price and offer availability may vary by model. Taxes and fees additional. No cash value. May not be combined with any other offers. Void where prohibited. Offer ends April 30, 2025. Shop for Tires",
      "Nissan Tire Price Match + 5% Credit* Bring in an eligible competitor quote and we will match the price and provide an additional 5% credit on select eligible tires.* Proof of eligibility required. *Eligible tires only. Customer must present a printed or digital lower-priced quote on an identical tire dated within 30 days of purchase from a tire retailer and installer within 100 miles of dealership. Internet quotes are only valid for competitors with a physical retail sales and installation location within the 100-mile radius. Bonus, bundled, free, or special offers; coupons, rebates, or promotions; clearance or closeout prices; used tires; ancillary parts; labor or other charges; typographical errors; competitor prices that result from a price match; quotes from other automotive dealerships; quotes located with Nissan dealer assistance; and internal repair orders are not eligible. Void where prohibited by law. Additional terms and restrictions may apply. See your dealer for full program details. Offer is subject to change at any time and/or is subject to termination without notice. Shop for Tires",
      "Complimentary Battery Inspection* With this complimentary service, our highly trained technicians will: Perform a thorough evaluation of your battery’s health using the latest testing equipment Visually assess your cable connections Recommend the exact fit for your Nissan if you need a new one *Available at participating Nissan dealers. Each dealer is independently operated. Availability of services or amenities may vary by dealer. Restrictions apply. Contact dealer for details. Schedule Service",
      "Complimentary Brake Inspection* With this special offer, the technicians at your local dealer will: Check brake fluid levels, color and signs of leaks Evaluate rotors and brake drums Inspect brake pad thickness and hardware *Available at participating Nissan dealers. Each dealer is independently operated. Availability of services or amenities may vary by dealer. Restrictions apply. Contact dealer for details. Find a Dealer",
      "5 Oil & Filter Changes, Under $55 Each* Ask your Service Advisor for details *Restrictions apply. Oil & Filter Change covers replacement of engine oil and oil filter. Replacement of covered parts/fluids will be made with Genuine Nissan or Nissan-approved replacement parts. Coverage begins on the date of purchase with the mileage on the vehicle's odometer on that date. In all cases, the Prepaid Maintenance Agreement (PMA) expires at the PMA Expiration Mileage or PMA Expiration Date. Administered by Nissan Extended Services North America (NESNA) P.O. Box 685004 Franklin, TN 37068-5004. NESNA reserves the right to reject any Application/Declaration for any reason at its discretion upon return of the full amount paid. READ A SAMPLE SECURITY+PLUS PREPAID MAINTENANCE AGREEMENT AT YOUR DEALER, BECAUSE ITS TERMS, CONDITIONS, EXCLUSIONS, AND LIMITATIONS CONTROL. Claim Now"
